---
const rolloutSteps = [
  {
    step: 'PHASE 01',
    timing: 'Day 1 (48 Hours)',
    title: 'Free 3-Document / 10-SKU Live Proof',
    description:
      'Send us 3 messy supplier invoices/DOs or 10 retail/F&B items on WhatsApp. We run them through our live AI OCR, ERPNext, or Offline POS sandbox so you see verified results on your own data before spending a sen.',
    deliverable: 'Verified JSON/Excel output + Live 15-min walkthrough',
    accent: 'sky',
  },
  {
    step: 'PHASE 02',
    timing: 'Days 2 – 14',
    title: 'Low-Risk 14-Day Production Pilot',
    description:
      'We deploy your Fast-Start Wedge Pilot (1 automated workflow, 1 LHDN MyInvois bridge, or 1 POS counter) alongside your existing setup. Zero disruption to daily operations, and 100% of the pilot fee is credited toward full rollout.',
    deliverable: 'Working production pilot + Baseline ROI benchmark',
    accent: 'emerald',
  },
  {
    step: 'PHASE 03',
    timing: 'Weeks 3 – 8',
    title: 'Parallel-Run Cutover & Staff Training',
    description:
      'We migrate your master data (from AutoCount, SQL, Xero, Excel, or SAP), run parallel verification until your trial balance and stock match 100%, and train your team with recorded role-by-role video SOPs.',
    deliverable: 'Reconciled Go-Live + 100% LHDN MyInvois compliance',
    accent: 'indigo',
  },
  {
    step: 'PHASE 04',
    timing: '1st of Every Month',
    title: 'Monthly Outcome Scorecard & Managed SLA',
    description:
      'Your system logs every invoice verified, staff hour reclaimed, LHDN UUID stamped, and regression bug blocked—sending leadership an auditable 1-page ROI Scorecard on the 1st of every month with $0 per-user seat fees.',
    deliverable: 'Monthly Executive ROI Report + 24/7 Uptime SLA',
    accent: 'amber',
  },
];

const ecosystemGroups = [
  {
    category: 'Malaysia Statutory, Tax & Banking Integrations',
    badge: '100% Local Compliance',
    items: [
      'LHDN MyInvois API (B2B, POS QR & Consolidated)',
      'Royal Malaysian Customs SST (6% / 8%)',
      'DuitNow QR & FPX Payment Gateways',
      'EPF (KWSP), SOCSO (PERKESO), EIS & PCB/MTD',
      'Maybank2E, CIMB BizChannel & Public Bank GIRO',
      'Singapore IRAS GST & InvoiceNow (Peppol)',
    ],
  },
  {
    category: 'Legacy Software We Migrate Or Bridge (Zero Data Loss)',
    badge: 'Seamless Cutover',
    items: [
      'AutoCount Accounting & POS',
      'SQL Accounting & Payroll',
      'UBS / Million / MYOB',
      'Xero & QuickBooks Online',
      'SAP Business One / Oracle NetSuite',
      'Odoo & Legacy Custom PHP/.NET/Java DBs',
    ],
  },
  {
    category: 'Omnichannel Commerce, Messaging & POS Hardware',
    badge: 'Real-Time Sync',
    items: [
      'WhatsApp Business Cloud API (24/7 Order Bot)',
      'Shopee, Lazada & TikTok Shop Seller Sync',
      'Shopify & WooCommerce B2B/B2C Stores',
      'ESC/POS Thermal Receipt Printers (USB/LAN/BT)',
      '2D Barcode Scanners, RFID & Weighing Scales',
      'Kitchen Display Systems (KDS) & Dual-Screen POS',
    ],
  },
];
---

<section
  id="how-we-work"
  class="scroll-mt-20 border-b border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-950/60 py-20 sm:py-24"
  aria-labelledby="how-we-work-heading"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-20">
    <!-- PART 1: 4-STEP ZERO-DISRUPTION IMPLEMENTATION TIMELINE -->
    <div>
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-300">
          Zero-Disruption Implementation Blueprint
        </span>
        <h2
          id="how-we-work-heading"
          class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl"
          data-i18n-en="From First WhatsApp to Production Go-Live in 4 Risk-Free Steps"
          data-i18n-bm="Dari WhatsApp Pertama ke Go-Live Sebenar Dalam 4 Langkah Tanpa Risiko"
          data-i18n-zh="从首次沟通到正式上线：零停机、零风险的 4 步落地流程"
        >
          From First WhatsApp to Production Go-Live in 4 Risk-Free Steps
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base text-slate-400">
          Worried that upgrading your ERP, POS, or automation will disrupt daily store or factory operations? We use a
          <strong class="text-white">Parallel-Run Cutover Method</strong>—we never switch off your old workflow until the new system is 100% verified.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {rolloutSteps.map((item) => (
          <div class="relative flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/90 bg-slate-900/60 p-6 transition hover:border-sky-500/40">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
                <span class="font-mono text-xs font-extrabold text-sky-400">{item.step}</span>
                <span class="rounded-full bg-slate-800 px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold text-emerald-300">
                  {item.timing}
                </span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="mt-3 text-base font-bold text-white leading-snug">{item.title}</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">{item.description}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-5 border-t border-slate-800/80 pt-3">
              <span class="block text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400">
                Milestone Gate:
              </span>
              <span class="mt-0.5 block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-200">{item.deliverable}</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PART 2: PLUG-AND-PLAY INTEGRATION & MIGRATION ECOSYSTEM -->
    <div>
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-indigo-500/30 bg-indigo-500/10 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo-300">
          Plug-and-Play Integration &amp; Migration Ecosystem
        </span>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl">
          Works With Your Current Accounting, Marketplaces, Banks &amp; POS Hardware
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-400">
          Whether you want to <strong class="text-white">bridge your existing software</strong> to LHDN MyInvois &amp; AI OCR, or
          <strong class="text-white">migrate cleanly into Frappe ERPNext</strong> with zero data loss, we support the entire Malaysian, SEA, and global B2B stack:
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
        {ecosystemGroups.map((group) => (
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/90 bg-slate-900/50 p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-slate-800 pb-3">
              <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">{group.category}</h3>
              <span class="shrink-0 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold text-emerald-300">
                {group.badge}
              </span>
            </div>
            <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-xs text-slate-300">
              {group.items.map((it) => (
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="mt-0.5 font-bold text-sky-400">✓</span>
                  <span>{it}</span>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PART 3: MALAYSIA TAX INCENTIVES & 3-POINT IRONCLAD CLIENT PROTECTION GUARANTEE -->
    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <!-- Left: Malaysia LHDN Tax Deduction & Grant Readiness -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 rounded-3xl border border-amber-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-900/95 to-amber-950/20 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-amber-500/30 bg-amber-500/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-300">
            🇲🇾 Malaysia Tax Deduction &amp; Grant-Ready Billing
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-white sm:text-2xl">
            Offset Your Implementation Cost with Malaysia’s e-Invoice Tax Deduction &amp; Capital Allowances
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
            Did you know Malaysian businesses can claim a <strong class="text-amber-300">Special Tax Deduction of up to RM 50,000 per Year of Assessment</strong> for LHDN e-Invoice (MyInvois) consultation and software implementation costs, plus <strong class="text-white">Accelerated Capital Allowance (ACA)</strong> on qualifying ICT &amp; automation systems?
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-300 pt-1">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="font-bold text-amber-400">▸</span>
              <span><strong class="text-white">Audit-Ready Itemized Invoicing:</strong> We structure our proposals and tax invoices with clear LHDN MyInvois consultation, software, and ICT automation line items for your tax agent/auditor.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="font-bold text-amber-400">▸</span>
              <span><strong class="text-white">Digitalisation Grant Documentation:</strong> Complete technical architecture blueprints and vendor quotation packs ready for SME digitalisation &amp; automation financing applications.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-2">
          <a
            href="#contact"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-amber-300 hover:text-amber-200"
          >
            <span>Request Grant &amp; Tax-Deductible Quotation Format</span>
            <span>→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: 3-Point Ironclad Client Protection Guarantee (Zero Vendor Lock-In) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 rounded-3xl border border-emerald-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-900/95 to-emerald-950/20 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-300">
            🛡️ Ironclad Client Protection &amp; Exit Guarantee
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-white sm:text-2xl">
            Zero Vendor Hostage Lock-In. You Own 100% of Your Code, Database &amp; Workflows.
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
            Many proprietary SaaS and ERP vendors hold your company’s historical data hostage if you ever stop paying their rising per-seat fees. Jobshore gives you three contractual guarantees in every engagement:
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-300 pt-1">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="font-bold text-emerald-400">1.</span>
              <span><strong class="text-white">100% Source Code &amp; Database Ownership:</strong> Full Git repository, Docker containers, Frappe custom apps, and PostgreSQL/MariaDB database ownership—deployable on your own cloud or on-premise servers anytime.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="font-bold text-emerald-400">2.</span>
              <span><strong class="text-white">100% Pilot Fee Credited to Full Rollout:</strong> Start with a small 14-day pilot; every sen you pay for the pilot is deducted from your full implementation milestone.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="font-bold text-emerald-400">3.</span>
              <span><strong class="text-white">Milestone Acceptance Sign-Off:</strong> You only release milestone payments when the agreed UAT checklist and math/ledger verification tests pass 100%.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-2">
          <a
            href="#contact"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-300 hover:text-emerald-200"
          >
            <span>Start With a Risk-Free 14-Day Pilot</span>
            <span>→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
